# Explicit protected control --env-file; ambient environment has no authority.
# The same typed YAML remains independently valid; all changes require restart.
# Combine with inherited knowledge/SSO/lifecycle policy entries in one protected file.

# Owner runtime.workflows.graph_bytes; integer UTF-8 bytes; optional, default 65536.
# Permitted 4096..1048576; enforce all WorkflowPolicy cross-field constraints.
